  "messageId": "<74022ae2464032d908471d86174462eb730b9843-20386348-111808576@google.com>",
  "subject": "[Action Advised] Review Google Cloud credential security best practices",
  "from": "\"Google Cloud\" <CloudPlatform-noreply@google.com>",
  "date": "2026-02-10T16:45:11.000Z",
  "text": "Secure service account and API keys to prevent unauthorized access.\n\n\n\n\nMY CONSOLE\n\n\n\n\nHello Christos,\n\nWe're writing to provide you with security best practices regarding the management of service account keys and API keys within your Google Cloud environment.\n\nRecent security trends indicate that long-lived credentials without proper security best practices remain a top security risk for unauthorized access. To ensure your environment remains secure, and to modernize your authentication strategy, we strongly advise implementing the unified security framework outlined below.\n\nWhat you need to do\n\nAction advised:\n\nSecure the credential lifecycle: Apply standard security hygiene by following these best practices:\n\n\nZero-Code Storage: Never commit keys to source code or version control. Use Secret Manager to inject credentials at runtime.\nDisable Dormant Keys: Audit your active keys and decommission any that show no activity over the last 30 days.\nEnforce API Restrictions: Never leave an API key unrestricted. Limit keys to specific APIs (eg, Maps Java Script only) and apply environmental restrictions (IP addresses, HTTP referrers, or bundle IDs).\nApply Least Privilege: Never give full permissions to a service account. Use the IAM recommender to prune unused permissions for service accounts, ensuring only the absolute minimum access required for their function.\nMandatory Rotation: Implement the iam.serviceAccountKeyExpiryHours policy to enforce a maximum lifespan for all user-managed service account keys. If service account keys are not needed, implement iam.managed.disableServiceAccountKeyCreation to disable the creation of new service account keys.\n\nImprove operational safeguards: Ensure a rapid response to security incidents by completing the following:\n\n\nSet Essential Contacts: Verify that your Essential Contacts are up to date to ensure critical security notifications reach the right people during an incident.\nSet Billing Anomaly and Budget Alerts: Ensure billing anomaly and budget alerts notifications are acted on. A sudden spike in consumption is often the first indicator of a compromised credential.\n\nWe're here to help\n\nWe are committed to helping you maintain a secure environment. If you have any questions or require assistance, please contact Google Cloud Support.\n\nThanks for choosing Google Cloud.\n\n\n\n\n\n– The Google Cloud Team\n\n\n\n\n\nDOCUMENTATION\n\n\n\nSUPPORT\n\n\n\n\n© 2026 Google LLC 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043\n\nYou've received this mandatory service announcement to update you about important changes to Google Cloud or your account.\n\n\n\nVisit Google Cloud blog Visit GCP on GitHub Visit Google Cloud on LinkedIn Visit Google Cloud on Twitter\n\n\n\n",
  "html": "<!doctype html public \"- / / w3c / / dtd html 4.01 transitional / / en\" \"http: / / www.w3.org / tr / html4 / loose.dtd\">\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<meta name=viewport content=width=device-width,initial-scale=1,user-scalable=yes>\n<title>Mandatory Service Announcement from Google Cloud</title>\n<html lang=en>\n<style>\n.appleLinksWhite a {\n  color: #898989 !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  cursor: default !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n\na {\n  color:#2979ff;\n  font-family:Roboto, arial;\n  font-size:14px;\n  text-decoration:none;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width : 0px) and (max-width : 480px) {\n  .flexible{ width: 100% !important; min-width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important;  }\n  .logo_holder, .logo_holder_td, .logo_right_holder, .logo_right_holder_td{width: 100% !important;}\n  .logo_right_holder_inner_td  {text-align:right !important;}\n  .logo_holder_td{padding-left: 16px;}\n  .logo_right_holder_td{padding-left: 16px !important; padding-top: 5px !important; padding-bottom: 15px !important;}\n  .tbl_banner{padding-left : 10px !important; padding-right: 10px !important; }\n  .banner_text_1{padding: 0 20px 15px 20px !important;}\n  .banner_container {background-position:top !important; background-color: #227cdf !important; height:auto !important;}\n  .banner_btn{padding-bottom:20px !important;}\n  .banner_text_2{128px 20px 13px 20px !important; font-size:26px !important;line-height:30px !important;}\n  .bottom_link_container_td{padding:10px 40px !important;}\n  .bottom_link_container_inner{padding:10px 0 !important;}\n  .bottom_link_text_mbl{padding:10px 0 !important;}\n  .outer_wrapper_td{padding:0 5px !important;}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width : 0px) and (max-width : 320px) {\n  .flexible{ width: 100% !important; min-width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important;  }\n  .logo_holder, .logo_holder_td, .logo_right_holder, .logo_right_holder_td{width: 100% !important;}\n  .banner_text_2{128px 20px 13px 20px !important; font-size:26px !important;line-height:30px !important;}\n  .logo_right_holder_td{padding-left: 16px !important; padding-top: 5px !important; padding-bottom: 15px !important;}\n  .logo_right_holder_inner_td  {text-align:right !important;}\n  .logo_holder_td{padding-left: 0 !important;}\n  .banner_text_1{padding: 0 20px 15px 20px !important;}\n  .banner_container {background-position:top !important; background-color: #227cdf !important; height:auto !important;}\n  .banner_btn{padding-bottom:20px !important;}\n  .bottom_link_container_td{padding:10px 40px !important;}\n  .bottom_link_text_mbl{padding:10px 0 !important;}\n  .outer_wrapper_td{padding:0 5px !important;}\n  .bottom_link_container_inner{padding:10px 0 !important;}\n  .social_icons_container_inner{width:210px !important;}\n  .tbl_banner{padding-left : 10px !important; padding-right: 10px !important; }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"-ms-text-size-adjust:100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; background:#fafafa; font-family:Arial; font-weight:normal; margin:0; padding:0; width:100%\" width=100%>\n\n\n  <!-- START PREHEADER TEXT -->\n  <!-- Displayed in the inbox preview, but does not appear in the message body. -->\n  \n    <div style=\"height:0px; font-size:0px; max-height:0px; min-height: 0px; line-height:0px; width: 100%; color: #fff; display:none;\">Secure service account and API keys to prevent unauthorized access. \n\n</div>\n  \n  <!-- END PRE-HEADER TEXT -->\n\n\n<table role=presentation class=\"outer_wrapper flexible\" width=100% align=center cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; background:#fafafa; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; margin:0; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; padding:0; width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<td class=outer_wrapper_td style=border-collapse:collapse><table class=\"inner_wrapper flexible\" align=center width=600 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; margin:0 auto; max-width:600px; min-width:600px; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:600px\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table width=600 class=\"header_wrapper flexible\" align=center cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; margin:0 auto; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:600px\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"header_wrapper_td \" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; padding:0 5px\">\n<table width=auto class=\"logo_holder flexible\" align=left cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:roboto, arial; font-weight:500; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:auto\">\n<tr>\n<td class=logo_holder_td style=\"border-collapse:collapse; padding-bottom:30px; padding-top:32px\">\n<img src=https://services.google.com/fh/files/emails/new_logo.png width=261 alt=\"\" style=\"-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; outline:none; text-decoration:none\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table role=presentation width=auto class=\"logo_right_holder flexible\" align=right cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:roboto, arial; font-weight:500; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:auto\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"logo_right_holder_td flexible\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; padding-right:0; padding-top:41px\">\n<table class=\"logo_right_holder_inner flexible\" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:roboto, arial; font-weight:500; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:auto\" width=auto>\n<tr>\n<td class=logo_right_holder_inner_td style=\"border-collapse:collapse; color:#90a4ae; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; line-height:16px\">\n\n\n  <!-- START MY CONSOLE LINK -->\n    <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26qu7114kLx8gQjqe8LS0gDhHVzk1t9AagmV6JonZLVyt5gSk1eHZPQOHWYVPOmdU23TRXWI6KZhPasg-KCoEqE7KQTtRmjV32AmzDtSiSaVi7gtFXrqdMpEA2V58_tw style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:16px; font-weight:500; line-height:16px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank>MY CONSOLE</a>\n  <!-- END MY CONSOLE LINK -->\n\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=border-collapse:collapse>\n<table width=598 class=\"content_wrapper flexible\" align=center cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; background:#ffffff; border-collapse:collapse; border-left:1px solid #e0e0e0; border-right:1px solid #e0e0e0; border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:598px; -moz-border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;  -webkit-border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; -khtml-border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text_wrapper flexible\" style=\"padding:30px 40px 0 40px; padding-top:35px; width:518px\" width=518>\n<table align=center style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; margin:auto; max-width:598px; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:518px\" class=\"holder_wrap_inner flexible\" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 width=518>\n\n\n  <!-- START TITLE TEXT -->\n  <!-- Comment this section out if not used. -->\n    <!--<tr>\n      <td class=\"text_wrapper_inner_td flexible\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; color:#455a64; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:24px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:17px\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>-->\n  <!-- END TITLE TEXT -->\n\n\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text_wrapper_inner_td flexible\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; color:#455a64; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:17px\">\n\n\n  <!-- START MESSAGE BODY TEXT -->\n\n  <!-- translation notice non-incident 5 locales -->\n \n\n  <!-- START MESSAGE BODY TEXT for EN w/ TN -->\n\n<p><a rel=nofollow style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#455A64\">Hello Christos</a>,</p>\n\n<p>We’re writing to provide you with security best practices regarding the management of service account keys and API keys within your <strong>Google Cloud</strong> environment.</p>\n\n<p>Recent security trends indicate that long-lived credentials without proper security best practices remain a top security risk for unauthorized access. To ensure your environment remains secure, and to modernize your authentication strategy, we strongly advise implementing the unified security framework outlined below.</p>\n\n<h3>What you need to do</h3>\n\n<p><strong>Action advised:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Secure the credential lifecycle:</strong> Apply standard security hygiene by following these best practices:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Zero-Code Storage:</strong> Never commit keys to source code or version control. Use <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26qvwm4Ojg7tGIJ6oWVyXYXHtbKaVhA20C3VzJDLBS8d_bZtL30z48ELsQQ6KxUlxvSNP4qHR5k4cm4yHyw3mHaQmEZpPCxmH_uwuZH3rdxArQbXhUFohdLuP7ITDtRISx0nmXjmhEJOFKx_x88Vc style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>Secret Manager</strong></a> to inject credentials at runtime.</li>\n  <li><strong>Disable Dormant Keys:</strong> <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26quM_1AgSvNvjtyyiryIyEHp1yTtXzPgqHNbtWBzaDk0nwGPGMMvqVR3qTijaXJcI850iBPNjpeT-kN5osl6xvFxz07gz57CcvIB6F4RJbpzlcF3_OzX5KSsHF2f6OD4qT0AVXLBpX0fOpYzprEo9zjHBBi8-D3fTMFookwkLw style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>Audit your active keys</strong></a> and decommission any that show no activity over the last <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Enforce API Restrictions:</strong> Never leave an API key unrestricted. Limit keys to specific APIs (e.g., <strong>Maps Java Script</strong> only) and apply environmental restrictions (IP addresses, HTTP referrers, or bundle IDs).</li>\n  <li><strong>Apply Least Privilege:</strong> Never give full permissions to a service account. Use the <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26qtd3ylCJaGqgaBVTAChiit9leaVdQbbMI6udnfSPGc6oI1Qn71tBGl_ySn0oN7GQLVwCipCMiYPYSi1Dob6NiITBJQp7eIAI7HUnMpYObWOUvJsN61denFKS8DugtNtwYXwWoWlFp7C7J2cbUovh8ZDRkmD2p-uobTV4R04ZH76cQ31egvmgefd5pPZbEYzckc style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>IAM recommender</strong></a> to prune unused permissions for service accounts, ensuring only the absolute minimum access required for their function.</li>\n  <li><strong>Mandatory Rotation:</strong> Implement the <a style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank href=https://c.gle/AEJ26quCwBMNq0SqFYYXjOzjoO0X1IZPSuBVSSBjWCBaHvNKpiMKUHYBHQtJjGeg3on6eSE7w3fjsXs0KLfgh7CQk6OSzry-RcsvBuB_yeVmJSVoTC8a3o4VXvyIvB5dVq1FU1Uq4DwbCXZu1nujjT3fOlR8U3nIE4Gp-zvxDX-N8TkEXj2AqWZNaafOi5qPQT9KaJJCWi7aQC4ShwdDps2gCiUcei9ouFjREUkQQTgqfj6QJR4><code>iam.serviceAccountKeyExpiryHours</code></a> policy to enforce a maximum lifespan for all user-managed service account keys. If service account keys are not needed, implement <a style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank href=https://c.gle/AEJ26qvuA46Fz1dSaFTuTIDM1pN3LPhbHnq-WL0MB1Jh356ds2X3wLfwW4mlpDYikneeLEfEXPIoMKjPJZp_o7nLRIfc1NFWlBZFbauuA9eXwbJmbr82FF3KGsumAe4Yp6G5s8RHadSIiaFWnhCFIjox-o-2bDnU2xGIiXw5bMMjW691ldRtIa3dm88UUMqfYw-S93GtetA8Uw9_mHErlz-LBiei99_paGsKBvbqFP0ub5wgG22FvXXwKMnm0VuhN6x0tWhcSu2Mj9M><code>iam.managed.disableServiceAccountKeyCreation</code></a> to disable the creation of new service account keys.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Improve operational safeguards:</strong> Ensure a rapid response to security incidents by completing the following:</p>\n\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Set Essential Contacts:</strong> Verify that your <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26quyftvD0o8f5OXQPb93X5R8WfGOtDoD3A92ZMOVqrS6cLLY5u5CpNLsgp7X8CYzf4-U3i9Jr5L2lpJzNMQrj21g6WpLpy_Ru5AXslbX-j_ejP7fHmoIEpH0-xH3HM9l7opFrrMoQOMKkIgSysW2A8nYI-UpzZ5R-3CJbF0oeQzhtbNDw8X1RcQTWw style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>Essential Contacts</strong></a> are up to date to ensure critical security notifications reach the right people during an incident.</li>\n  <li><strong>Set Billing Anomaly and Budget Alerts:</strong> Ensure <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26quPSHeLBBpg4Ea9fX_pFENzWj3sWUTZ2I1XbvAom5jGX1QbrEavIlZL4uHQnIJsAB5lqyiFefxhOcP9SnJtKnSpAIiUo6_dZeq-gG9p9BdOw2kGMPnGWlZrzSaY-5h6zHFWWyf63nxkU0NQJ-eyBzwUIUf8fBpd_IhLfSGoih4 style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>billing anomaly</strong></a> and <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26qt7TfMxZjmaFGg4U_Zl8F98azbnxslfL1Z24KMkDxwgeGGPogg1LybwkhNsMGjWd2nNt9nVf2pm79kRCSg9GpmRLn-z0P7hJ5lkBsggNEvVeqPEc6J79_O7cd4i_MDBgyQVU9I8aqmacDlHIWR_OUZHEWfPx1M style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank><strong>budget alerts</strong></a> notifications are acted on. A sudden spike in consumption is often the first indicator of a compromised credential.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3>We’re here to help</h3>\n\n<p>We are committed to helping you maintain a secure environment. If you have any questions or require assistance, please contact <a href=https://c.gle/AEJ26quF7zO5w48x7AGCFxFc1dxRrGGsErQy47eQ6CDAIU09z85tWstVl5lNmA5z2wYDgaXGmBcZb2nGy0dxWbCEptS0rlIfSgqtBmuKIatAJxI_sIIj-DQiSzU style=\"color:#1a73e8; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none\" target=_blank>Google Cloud Support</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for choosing Google Cloud.</p>\n\n  <!-- END MESSAGE BODY TEXT for EN w/ TN-->\n\n\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"banner_btn grey_line\" style=\"border-bottom:2px #eef1f2 solid; border-collapse:collapse; padding-bottom:26px; padding-top:9px\">\n<div>\n\n\n \n\n\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=text_wrapper style=\"padding:30px 40px 20px 40px; width:518px\" width=518>\n\n\n  <!-- Please make a copy of the snippet template '13677366' and follow the steps on our internal site for EN w/ TN-->    \n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"border-collapse:collapse; color:#455a64; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:16px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:12px; font-weight:500;\">– The Google Cloud Team</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n  <!-- END VALEDICTION for EN w/ TN-->\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text_wrapper_inner_td  flexible\" style=\"color:#455a64; font-family:Roboto, arial; font-size:14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:17px\">\n<table class=\"inner_wrapper bottom_link_container flexible\" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; -premailer-cellspacing:0; background:#ffffff; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0; border-collapse:collapse; border-left:1px solid #e0e0e0; border-right:1px solid #e0e0e0; border-top:2px solid #eef1f2; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:normal; margin:0 auto; max-width:600px; min-width:600px; mso-table-lspace:0; mso-table-rspace:0; width:598px;  -moz-border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; -webkit-border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; -khtml-border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;\" width=598 align=center>\n<tr><td class=\"bottom_link_container_td flexible\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; padding:25px 40px 27px 40px\">\n<table class=\"bottom_text_1 flexible\" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=0 width=172 align=left style=\"-premailer-cellpadding:0; 